      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "παύσ-ειν, ‘to be about to stop (someone else)’\nTo form the future active infinitive, add -ειν to the future stem, e.g.\nπαύσω, ‘I shall stop’ > παύσ-ειν, ‘to be about to stop’\nποιήσω, ‘I shall do’ > ποιήσ-ειν, ‘to be about to do’",
      "lang": "mixed",
      "para_no": null,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
      "exercise": null,
      "caption": null,
      "uncertain": []
    },
    {
