        907
      ],
      "margin_number": null,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "παύσ-εσθαι, ‘to be about to stop (oneself), cease’\nTo form the future middle infinitive, add -εσθαι to the future stem, e.g.\nπαύσομαι, ‘I shall stop (myself)’ > παύσ-εσθαι, ‘to be about to stop\n(oneself), cease’\nδέξομαι, ‘I shall receive’ > δέξ-εσθαι, ‘to be about to receive’",
      "lang": "mixed",
